{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちはるーむへようこそ(｡･o･｡)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"少し時間が無いので\n今日はアンダーメンバーとのオフショット♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/06/30/9840579/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かなと見つめ合う。\nじーー。\nかなの目が茶色かった。\n透き通ってて綺麗だった。\n吸い込まれるかと思った。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/06/30/9840579/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あやねちゃん♡\nいいこいいこさせてくれた(﹡ˆ ˆ﹡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"可愛いな〜\n結構私にフレンドリーなの。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/06/30/9840579/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"愛未とひなちま♡\n私、この2人本当に仲良し！\nずっと一緒だよ〜\\( ˆoˆ )/\nなかよしこよし。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/06/30/9840579/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"優里、川後、かりん、あやねちゃん♡\nこんな感じの席順で座っているから\nメンバーの裏側が垣間見えるでしょ( ◦˙ ˙◦ )\nアンダーはみんな仲良し！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/06/30/9840579/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"万理華の睨み顔。\nこんな顔してるけど怖くないぞー♡\nノリがいいのさ〜楽しい！\n笑顔が可愛くて(﹡ˆ ˆ﹡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はここまで！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーとのこんな写真が見たい〜！！\nこんなポーズをみてみたい！！\nみたいのがあったら教えてほしいな♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"-------------------------♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメント読んでるとみなさん本当\n物知りで凄い！って思います(｡･o･｡)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもいつも勉強になります♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでいて励ましのコメントや\n応援コメントもしてくださっていて\n嬉しくなれる！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもありがとう♡\n全部読んでるよ〜(﹡ˆ ˆ﹡)\n待ってるね♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日内容薄くてごめんね⸜(  ⌓̈ )⸝\nまた更新するからね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"斎藤ちはる"}],"source":"archive"}